## Work performed

1. Created test-strategy-phase2.md as the isolated canonical Phase 2
   strategy/contract file. It defines:
   - Contract C1: fail-closed mapping from the verified Company Identity tuple
     (applicationKey=sales, organizationId, organizationKey) to one dedicated
     Mastery tenant; no caller tenant selection; Codecamp namespace exclusion.
   - Contract C2: durable idempotent projection command binding organization,
     learner principal, source application, graph release, source-attempt
     identity, idempotency key, and payload digest; equal replay returns the
     original receipt; conflicting replay fails closed.
